{"seq":3,"slug":"hyperparameter","title":"超参数工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-space-design","title":"搜索空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/search-space-design","wordCount":1481,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-stopping-scheduling","title":"早停与调度策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/early-stopping-scheduling","wordCount":1535,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-parallel-search","title":"分布式并行搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/hyperparameter/distributed-parallel-search","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"超参数工程\">超参数工程</h1><p>算法本身只是工具——真正决定调参成败的往往是工程层面的决策。搜索空间设计决定了优化器能触达什么解；早停与调度策略决定了有限预算如何分配给每次试验；分布式并行搜索决定了整体墙钟时间能压缩多少。本章三篇文档从&quot;定义问题&quot;到&quot;加速求解&quot;形成递进：先设计好空间，再为每次评估配置资源策略，最后将整个搜索过程横向扩展到多节点集群。</p>\n"}